OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 4 JAN
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GIsabelle Faust plays Dvorak's
OL,6,     Gcolourful, folk-inspired violin
OL,7,     Gconcerto. Andris Nelsons leads
OL,8,     Gthe Leipzig Gewandhaus Orchestra
OL,9,     Gin Sibelius's second symphony.
OL,10,G0630FBreakfast
OL,11,     GElizabeth Alker presents Radio
OL,12,     G3's Breakfast show. To get in
OL,13,     Gtouch, email 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,14,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,15,     GSarah Walker with three hours of
OL,16,     Gclassical music to reflect,
OL,17,     Grestore and refresh whether
OL,18,     Gyou're basking in the last of the
OL,19,     Gfestive lights or getting started
OL,20,     Gon some resolutions...
